# Sibling deliverables — the matched-pairs and charts pages, the scripts that
# make them, and their data. Not part of the site. index.html depends only on
# build_master_table.py, make_benchmark_doc.py and benchmark_template.html;
# everything below is a separate work product kept on disk for local use.
# build_all.py does not run them; each is invoked on its own.
